_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","review_id":"RlxyMy3Bj8jKo_XYOc4GJw","date":"2017-07-11T19:55:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9465230703353882,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by Courtyard after dinner on Saturday. It's a cool industrial vibe with an outdoor area and some seats inside. They have a variety of food trucks there as well. The menu takes a while to read and figure out what you want. They had a lot of IPAs this week so I'm not sure if there was a reason for that. I don't like IPAs, though. I tend to like dark beers (yes, even in summer) and they were out of the one I wanted to try. The other was PB Stout and if there's one thing I hate, it's peanut butter. So I was left with one option. Luckily, they let me taste it and it was really good. The bartenders were really nice. I even share a hatred of peanut butter with one of them. We bonded for ..."},{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","review_id":"xiUSV9jfu0hRiQelLXe8dA","date":"2014-12-30T21:49:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9438514709472656,"text_excerpt":"I'm not a big beer fan, but this place was able to give me a couple beers I enjoyed. The space isn't huge, but there is a TON of outdoor space begging to be utilized. They just opened, so I am excited to see how they utilize the outdoor space and for their new homebrews."},{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","review_id":"McXlLd1WrWV_omHnh2B60Q","date":"2017-07-01T20:15:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9398255944252014,"text_excerpt":"This was our final brewery stop on our impromptu 'let's get lit before heading to the airport' tour. Courtyard is an interesting little place...it looks kind of like a blend between a warehouse and a trailer that you might see on some random tropical vacation. Like it doesn't belong there but thank goodness it's there because it ends up being a cool place to chill at amongst the craziness of all the other touristy places you've previously visited. I also like its mish-mash of crazy seating all over the place and its random bathrooms (that yes, you have to wash your hands in the community sink between the two sliding barn door bathrooms...but that shouldn't be a problem if you WASH YOUR HA..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","photo_id":"n5jpwOc9nn7bnb_0TMqaJw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/n5jpwOc9nn7bnb_0TMqaJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8755070567131042},{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","photo_id":"dfT4_tiunRqjIJTEHC4n1Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dfT4_tiunRqjIJTEHC4n1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.831242561340332},{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","photo_id":"P5vZ0F9Nfqv6LdcvdlvbXw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/P5vZ0F9Nfqv6LdcvdlvbXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8255501985549927},{"business_id":"XCDXN4xJh3-DauaO88CZHQ","photo_id":"HOfNj_w52HCqMlauZrw8Jw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HOfNj_w52HCqMlauZrw8Jw.jpg","visual_represent